Cleanroom FFU and Filter market leaders include global filtration specialists Daikin, Camfil, Parker Hannifin, and MANN+HUMMEL. They collectively hold more than 35 % of worldwide sales and leverage extensive product lines that blend high efficiency media with energy saving fan designs. Their distribution networks span North America, Europe, and Asia Pacific, enabling rapid deployment in large scale semiconductor fabs and pharmaceutical sites.
